WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.090 align:start position:0%
 
at the start of the movie A group of  teens enter an abandoned building in the  middle of the city they appear to be  looking for someone very important just  then the building starts shaking as if  an earthquake is hit the group dashes  out of the place in horror but what they  see outside sends shivers down their  spines the city which was sprawling with  life just a few minutes ago has been  laid to complete waste by a nuclear  strike it appears as if another world  war has recently taken place and for  some reason the only building that has  been unaffected is the one the teens  were in a while ago as expected the  teens become scared and rush back into  the building they believe that they are  hallucinating and decide to sleep there  until everything is fine 36 hours pass  by and once again another earthquake  hits the building when the group  Ventures out this time they notice a  highly futuristic city which is several  hundred years more advanced than the  real one in this world currency has  become Obsolete and everything is bought  via a fingerprint scan the group is left  in utter disbelief at the strange  occurrences and they finally deduce that  the building teleport them to a  different version of Earth every 36  hours then we are taken back to a few  days ago on how it all started Ronin is  a struggling boxer while his sister  Beatrix is an aspiring University  student both of them have been out of  contact for quite some time now but  today they separately receive a voice  message from their estranged father Alex  who requests they meet him he also  mentions a certain building on 156  Prospect Street which is revealed to be  the same one from the start of the movie  although the siblings are not thrilled  to be contacted by their absent father  they still decide to meet him at Alex's  house Beatrix and Ronan run into each  other and find out that their father has  been missing they searched the whole  place but find nothing suspicious then  they go to check the garage where  beatrix's childhood friend Harry also  shows up and decides to help them in the  search soon the group finds Alex's  emergency bag which has a strange  ball-shaped device in it there is also a  newspaper article which reads that Bill  Clinton has been assassinated this is  extremely weird as the former U.S  president is still alive the only person  that ever did anything to Bill's ass was  that sweet sweet Hillary a while later  the worried siblings head to the police  station to report their father's  disappearance however after hearing them  out officer Stone mentions that he can  do little to help them as they don't  know if Alex has really gone missing or  has voluntarily disappeared in a  last-ditch effort to ask for help Ronan  talks about the building his father had  mentioned earlier but the cop once again  dismisses it claiming that it is  abandoned with no other leads the trio  decides to go to the building as they  were told it is abandoned however on the  walls they noticed strange graffiti that  describes alternate timelines and  histories for instance one writing says  on my Earth terrorists flew planes into  the Twin Towers on October 23 2001. this  puzzles them as the terrorists actually  flew into the Twin Towers on September  11 2001. another writing says avoid  Earth 33 the contagion has spread while  another still says Earth 468 is safe  locals are friendly no weapons it turns  out that there are many alternate  universes where things happen  differently I want to go to the one  where where Sonic the Hedgehog is real  suddenly the trio hears loud thudding  noises which causes the building to  shake and the lights to flicker  frightened they try to run out but find  themselves locked inside the building  after a while they eventually managed to  get out but are taken aback to discover  that the building has transported them  to an alternate Earth devastated by  nuclear blasts soon they noticed some  pedestrians and ask for help but instead  get threatened with guns just then a  roving Patrol shows up and shoots down  the pedestrians prompting Ronan and the  others to flee back into the building  Harry being a nerd theorizes that there  are many versions of Earth and somehow  the building has teleported them into a  different version this also explains the  strange graffiti they saw earlier inside  the building they meet a woman named  Paulie who claims to be a traveler  Between Worlds she confirms Harry's  doubts and explains that the building  transports anyone within it to a new  random world every 36 hours in hostile  worlds such as the one in which they  currently reside she suggests that they  stay inside the building and not  interact with the locals hearing all  this the group ultimately decides to  sleep to pass the time but after a while  they're woken up by the same armed  Patrol that murdered the pedestrians in  the next scene Ronan and the others are  taken to a nearby settlement where they  are confronted by their fearless leader  surprisingly he turns out to be the  alternate version of Officer Stone as  the two parties talk it's clear that the  armed Patrol are not aware of the  existence of alternate universes Paulie  decides to hide this information from  them and makes up a story that they are  merely confused travelers from Kansas  who are heading up North however Harry  recognizes officer Stone from their  world and thanks him for his help this  puzzle Stone as it turns out that before  this version of Earth was nuked he was a  police officer here as well hence he  concludes that the four are spies from a  rival gang and takes them hostage God  damn it Harry he then orders Tinker the  local surgeon and Gadget man to  interrogate them first Beatrix and Ronan  are selected and before their  interrogation starts Beatrix airs her  personal grievances with her elder  brother calling him out for abandoning  her after their mother's death it turns  out Ronan blames himself for their  mother's death and claims that he  distanced himself from their family  because he always ends up hurting his  loved ones soon Tinker shows up and  starts chatting with the siblings he  appears to be the only one who is aware  of the alternate universes he reveals  that this Earth was an amazing place to  live until the Islamic Republic of  Pakistan collapsed in 99 and its nukes  found their way around the world the  bombs which were the size of suitcases  were sold in the market and in no time  they got into the wrong hands and  wrecked everything Tinker further  reveals that the man who first brought  the nukes to his City came out of the  building he then shows them footage of  the nuclear terrorist attack and in a  shocking turn of events the perpetrator  is revealed to be Ronan and beatrix's  Dad Alex he is the main reason why this  version of Earth was destroyed as the  siblings watch in horror Tinker grows  increasingly angry and threatens to kill  them if they don't reveal their father's  whereabouts I think he went out for milk  they say Beatrix tries to explain that  she doesn't know where Alex is but the  gadget man refuses to listen for a split  second Tinker takes his eyes off of  Ronan allowing the former boxer to  administer a Chokehold and subdue him  then he breaks free from his bondage and  also helps Beatrix up meanwhile Tinker  wakes up desperate for revenge and sets  off his own suitcase bomb to take  everyone down with him seeing this Ronan  once again knocks him out with a solid  punch to the face then the siblings  quickly free their friends and rush back  to the building in one of their  abductors cars after a while Stone  learns about the bomb and orders Tinker  to shut it down however the gadgetman  refuses to comply and reveals his plan  to take the bomb to blow up the building  before leaving he advises his comrades  to go the other way to save themselves  elsewhere as Ronan and the others reach  halfway their getaway car runs out of  fuel forcing them to make the rest of  their Journey on foot they safely make  it into the building but so does tanker  who has arrived outside with the bomb  fortunately the building transports them  to the next World just in time to escape  the nuclear blast Harry is under the  impression that there are finally going  back home but Paulie tells him that  there is no going back home and heads  out surprisingly this world is more  technologically advanced than their  version of Earth for instance the  smartphones and laptops are all  transparent the little fancy the group  assumes that they have traveled to the  future but Paulie reminds them that it  is just a different version of Earth in  the same year to learn more about the  place they split up but unbeknownst to  them it's revealed that tanker has also  arrived in this world on their way Harry  stops to buy something and learns that  everyone pays with their fingerprint the  fingerprint scan reveals that in this  world Harry is a wealthy and corrupt  corporate lawyer seconds after they  leave the shop Tinker arrives there buys  all the gadgets he can and gets busy  working on something turns out that he  too is a wealthy guy in this world  meanwhile Harry and Beatrix sneak into  this world's Harry's apartment and hack  into his computer interestingly both  Harry's have the same computer password  Beatrix 928 it's clear that he has a  major crush on Beatrix which she was a  woman obvious about until now Beatrix  then looks up her dad online and learns  that in this world her father Alex died  three months ago in an accident at work  I.E the same building they also find out  that Beatrix went to college and Ronan  didn't exist in this world on the other  hand Ronan and Paulie explore Alex's  house which turns out to be empty he  then shows her the device he found  earlier which Paulie immediately  recognizes she reveals that it could  only be from the core World which is the  world where the building was constructed  Paulie comments that the core world must  be thousands of years ahead of the real  Earth in terms of Technology after a  while Ronan opens up about his troubled  childhood where he had a bad temper and  often got into fights he also reveals  the reason why he blames himself for his  mother's death one day while Ronan and  his mom were driving home he got into a  fight with a trucker on the highway his  mother tried to stop the fight but in  the process got run over by a speeding  vehicle after that the Carver family  fell apart a grief-stricken Alex stopped  working and Beatrix had to cancel her  College plans to take care of him after  finishing up his story Ronan leads  Paulie to his dad's car on searching it  they come across a bag that contains a  message telling Ronan to get out of the  house immediately suddenly a car pulls  up outside and the same three men from  earlier emerge ordering Alex to come out  when no one responds the men barge  inside but Ronan and Paulie swiftly take  them out after this the two get inside  the Assassin's car and flee meanwhile  Harry learns that his Doppelganger from  this world has done some very bad things  hence he gathers up some evidence and  emails it to the media exposing his  other self brutally Tinker finally  completes working on his device using  which he can seemingly control the  City's power system he then drags the  device back to the building and soon  Ronan and Paulie also show up after a  small confrontation between the two men  Tinker assumes that the caretaker of the  building is hiding nearby hence using  his invention he wants to hack into the  building and bring out the caretaker  just then Harry and Beatrix also arrive  and the latter threatens to kill Tinker  however Ronan convinces her to stand  down as he too wants to find answers  with the approval from the group Tinker  finally starts his device and this  causes the building to shake violently  for a while no one emerges but when  Tinker increases the power and threatens  to destroy the building someone comes  out from the elevator shockingly it is  none other than Alex himself he commends  Tinker on his ability to connect with  the building and then direct him to the  top floor claiming this is where all the  answers are once Tinker leaves Alex  tells his children that he and their  mother were not born in what they  perceived as their home World much to  their shock he then instructs Ronan and  Beatrix to find their mother claiming  that she is the only one who can take  them back to the core world the  ball-shaped device from earlier is the  key to finding her Alex further mentions  that the building has been running for a  long time and whatever its original  purpose was and whoever built it are  long gone in fact he is not the  caretaker of the place but a regular  passenger who wants to find answers just  like everyone else suddenly tank arrives  at the elevator screaming at Alex for  deceiving him but before he can say  anything further he is shot and killed  by the cunning old man Alex then leaves  the building despite the children  pleading with him to stay after the  building transports them once again  Ronan Beatrix and Harry venture out to  explore the new world while Paulie waits  for someone suddenly two more versions  of Paulie who had been hiding in the  building all along show up the movie  ends as the three doppelgangers play  Rock Paper Scissors to determine who  will accompany the rest of the group  into the new world subscribe for more  videos like this turn on notifications  and leave a like to help the channel out  thank you for watching

